{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14814","headline":"詶金部王郎中省中春日见寄 · 卢纶","name":"詶金部王郎中省中春日见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫树色晓森森，虽有春光未有阴。\n鹤侣正疑芳景引，玉人那爲簿书沈。\n山含瑞气偏当日，莺逐轻风不在林。\n更有阮郎迷路处，万株红树一溪深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}